# PesaCore — Code Owners
#
# Default owner for everything in the repository.
# When a Cigna platform team adopts this template, this file is overwritten
# with the actual platform team's GitHub team handle (e.g., @cigna-ioh/platform).
#
# Cigna IOH context: CODEOWNERS is how a paved-road template enforces
# review discipline. PRs to platform-owned files (CI workflows, IaC, web.config)
# require platform-team approval; PRs to feature code stay with the feature team.

# Catch-all — every file requires the project owner's review by default.
*                                       @ericgitangu

# Platform-team-owned files — never modify without platform-team approval.
/.github/                               @ericgitangu
/infra/                                 @ericgitangu
/Properties/PublishProfiles/            @ericgitangu
/web.config                             @ericgitangu
/appsettings.json                       @ericgitangu
/appsettings.Production.json            @ericgitangu
/appsettings.IIS.json                   @ericgitangu
/Program.cs                             @ericgitangu

# Migration / docs — paved-road documentation.
/docs/                                  @ericgitangu
